    latent families never rescale by construction). Audited 2026-07-18:
    engine behavior spot-checked, dbartsSampler-class.Rd documents the
    default, NEWS 1.0-0 UPGRADING carries the bullet. Point the
    reporter at the Rd and NEWS entries.
  write cran-comments.md at submission time. Content it needs: major
